    id 61
    label "2yj6jLY5YHI"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-30T14:17:31Z"
    title "Nanoglue: Nanotechnology to boost wound closure"
    description "Cutting-edge nanotechnology to boost wound closure and keep tissue alive &#8211; made in Switzerland. Nanoglue's unique formulation based on cutting-edge nanotechnology boosts the body's own capacity of self-healing and keeps bacterial infections in check. The Empa and ETH spin-off &#34;anavo&#34;'s nanoparticle paste helps surgeons who want to ensure patient safety and survival by reducing skin transplantation complications and providing swift healing.&#10;www.anavo.ch&#10;www.empa.ch"
    channeltitle "EmpaChannel"
