    description "&#34;Nanotechnology capsules&#34; is a project that seeks to bring and disseminate scientific activity of Nanotechnology to society and pursues the quest for achieving social impact scientists involving different actors, from researchers to a general public, to students high school, college, professional and technical teachers. In this sense, the main idea of the proposed approach nanotech activity is essential as it our main motivation is derived: the transfer of knowledge generated in the nanotechnology field and the promotion of scientific culture and innovation between the public objective, promoting understanding of the concepts related to innovation.&#10;&#10;This project has been funded by the Fundacion Espa&#241;ola para la Ciencia y la Tecnolog&#237;a (FECYT) - Ministerio de Econom&#237;a y Competitividad and the Catedra SAMCA of Nanotechnology.&#10;&#10;Please, check this evaluation survey when you had seen the video: http://goo.gl/forms/3EbaS10Lys"
