    title "Future Benefits of Nanotechnology | Good Developments"
    description "The real challenge is using these techniques reliably to create working nanoscale devices. The physical qualities of matter, such as its melting point, electrical conductivity, and chemical reactivity, become very different at the nanoscale, so shrinking a device can affect its performance. If we can master this technology, then we have the opportunity to improve not just electronics but all sorts of areas of modern life. That's why we will tell you about the future benefits of nanotechnology. So stick around till the end. &#10;&#10;Subcribe! https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEhnhGTQ6OGBSSWQtR7wPgw/featured"
