    id 141
    label "W_c6ntutPfs"
    step 0
    date "2021-08-26T10:38:40Z"
    title "Nanotechnology for the enhancement of Agricultural productivity- Times Of Biotech"
    description "Since the beginning of human civilization, agriculture has played a crucial role in the economy worldwide. In fact, in 2018, its contribution was 4% to global GDP and more than 25% to the GDP of some developing countries. It is a backbone of developing countries as it ensures food security. Growth in agriculture can raise the income of the poorest, leading to a reduction in poverty faster than any other sector. However, the efforts to increase the productivity of agriculture are facing various challenges of biotic and abiotic stress.&#10;The majority of scientists are working to solve this problem by using various modern technologies and techniques such as CRISPR/Cas9 for Genetic manipulation, Intensive tillage, Monoculture, Use of synthetic fertilizers, irrigation technologies, chemical pest control Etc. However, here we will discuss the application of Nanotechnology: one of the emerging techniques contributing to the agrotechnological revolution.  &#10;&#10;Copyright Disclaimer - under Section 107 of the copyright act 1976, allowance is made for fair use for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statutes that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favour of fair use. PDF of this presentation is available on our &#10;&#10;Official website - https://timesofbiotech.com/ &#10;Or send us an email at timesofbiotech1@gmail.com for the same. &#10;&#10;Know CRISPR/Cas - https://youtu.be/C56cNNFerPI &#10;Plant Tissue Culture Media-  https://youtu.be/_inV2jzu1MQ &#10;&#10;#nanofertilizers #nanopesticides #nanosensors #agriculture #nanotechnology&#10;what is nanotechnology &#10;what is nanotechnology used for&#10;what is nanotechnology in medicine&#10;what is nanotechnology engineering&#10;what is nanotechnology pdf&#10;what is nanotechnology meaning&#10;what is nanotechnology in hindi&#10;what is nanotechnology in agriculture&#10;what is nanotechnology upsc&#10;what is nanotechnology ppt&#10;introduction what is nanotechnology&#10;define what is nanotechnology&#10;what is nanotechnology examples&#10;is nanotechnology real&#10;what is nanotechnology used for&#10;what is nanotechnology in medicine&#10;introduction to nanotechnology&#10;what is nanotechnology&#10;nanotechnology uses"
    channeltitle "Times Of Biotech"
