  [
    id 206
    label "58uOozdeNl0"
    step 0
    date "2017-02-14T17:14:35Z"
    title "Rice Universitys Dr. Richard Smalley on the Future of Nanotechnology"
    description "Dr. Richard Smalley explains his discoveries from his research and his experiences in nanotechnology.&#10;&#10;Dr. Richard Smalley died from leukemia on October 28, 2005 at the age of 62. He is remembered for his great contributions to the field of nanotechnology. Smalley was deemed as the &#34;Father of Nanotechnology&#34; by the U.S. Senate after his death. &#10;(Info gathered from Smalley's obituary)&#10;&#10;Filmed on June 23, 2005 in the Nano Lab at Rice University."
