    title "Nanotechnology in Industrial Lubricants with Dr George Diloyan, CEO of Nanotech Industrial Solutions"
    description "This video is a part of&#160;TRIBOLOGY DISCUSSIONS WEBINAR, organized by Ducom Instruments. Special thanks to the host,&#160;&#160;Deepak Halenahally Veeregowda, Ph.D.&#10;&#10;IF-WS2 is TESTED PROVEN TRUSTED &#8211; ASK US HOW, WHEN AND WHY &#10;&#10;Inorganic Fullerene-like Tungsten Disulfide submicron particles based dispersions in oil,  grease,  water, and other media are used now in a myriad of applications, including, but not limited to metalworking fluids, coatings, polymers, greases, industrial oils, automotive, mining industry, mining equipment, marine, military steel industry.&#10;&#10;&#10;www.nisusacorp.com&#10;Follow us: http://www.linkedin.com/company/nanotech-industrial-solutions-inc&#160;&#10;&#10;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ApNano&#160;&#10;&#10;Nanotech Industrial Solutions (NIS) is the only manufacturer of spherical nanoparticles of Inorganic Fullerene-like Tungsten Disulfide (IF-WS&#8322;). These particles provide UNMATCHED extreme pressure (EP), antiwear (AW), antifriction (AF), and shock-absorbing properties to various industrial lubricants. Adding IF-WS2 will bring High efficiency, reduce equipment downtime, lower operational temperature, and minimize the overall cost of ownership.&#160;&#10;&#10;NIS' IF-WS2 nanoparticles are eco-friendly! Non-toxic and safe for the environment. REACH registered.&#160;&#10;&#10;&#10;NIS's lubricant additives (oil, grease, water-based Metalworking fluid)&#160;may be used in many industrial applications, including but not limited to mining, oil and gas drilling, metal forming, steel mills, power generation plants, railroad, moving freight and fleet management, space &#38; defense.&#160;&#10;&#10;NIS offers a unique Private Label Program for Grease and Engine Oil Booster for manufacturers and dealers:&#160;http://nisusacorp.com/turn-key_program/&#160;&#10;&#10;Check out our other videos on nanotechnology:&#160;&#10;https://youtu.be/k9d6y8NzM0Y&#10;https://youtu.be/V5gOFJbobGo"
