    step 0
    date "2022-02-04T10:30:00Z"
    title "Nanotechnology - Part 1 | Science  Technology | Tone Academy | Nikhil"
    description "Nanotechnology is the most under-tapped area in the field of Science and Technology in India.&#10;This video explains in-depth about:&#10;i. Definition of Nanotechnology&#10;ii. Generations of Nanotechnology&#10;iii. Types of Nanotechnology&#10;iv. Advantages &#38; Disadvantages of Nanotechnology&#10;v. Applications of Nanotechnology&#10;vi. Problems with Nanotechnology&#10;vii. Issues with Nanotechnology in India&#10;&#10;#Nanotechnology #GenerationsinNanotechnology #RichardFeyman #PassiveNanostructure #ActiveNanostructure #SystemofNanostructure #TypesofNanotechnology #AdvantagesandDisadvantagesofNanotechnology #ApplicationofNanotechnologyinElectronicsITMedicalandHealthcareApplication #EnergyApplication #EnvironmentalRemediation #FutureTransportation #ProblemswithNanotechnology #IssueswithNanotechnologyinIndia&#10;&#10;For any queries/doubts/information - we are just an email away - mail us @ askme@toneacademy.in &#10;&#10;Subscribe to : https://bit.ly/2YQOgbs &#10;&#10;Landforms Of The Earth &#8211; Plateaus - https://youtu.be/Z4ns_Txltc8&#10;&#10;Articles -  https://youtu.be/C8SyvvYDIKU&#10;&#10;Urban Land Ceiling Act, 1976 - https://youtu.be/rLE72KHJmhE&#10;&#10;Kepler&#8217;s Law &#38; Satellite Orbits - https://youtu.be/Jot5fgiK5EA&#10;&#10;Pipes &#38; Cisterns- Concept - 7 - More or Less - https://youtu.be/wB5QjRBN4lw&#10;&#10;Buddhism-Five Great Events in Buddha&#8217;s Life - https://youtu.be/sFWGaD_U74Y&#10;&#10;Subject &#38; Predicate - https://youtu.be/JugOlZc3k6A&#10;&#10;Alexander&#8217;s Invasion &#8211; Impact - https://youtu.be/nCaeta2CvIk&#10;&#10;Fundamental Rights - Right To Constitutional Remedies Part 15 - https://youtu.be/2voQOxnQ76w&#10;&#10;Igneous Rocks -  https://youtu.be/q4DfTliVbTI&#10;&#10;The Rise Of Magadhan Empire - https://youtu.be/MK0dw5CIbXE&#10;&#10;Position Of Letters When Word Is Arranged Alphabetically - https://youtu.be/qw8PxrtITxE&#10;&#10;Next Generation Space Vehicles &#8211; https://youtu.be/JkclfNAZ6Kc&#