    step 0
    date "2021-05-15T16:14:06Z"
    title "Nanotechnology: Growing In A Shrinking World"
    description "Nanotechnology is ironically becoming larger by the day, but not literally.  It is an emerging science that is expected to have rapid and strong future developments and is one of the most exciting and fast-moving areas of science today. This technology has already shown applications and massive developments in the medicine, electronics, food industry, and still has everyone's eyes to watch out for.&#10;&#10;What do you think about Nanotechnology? Write your thoughts in the comments down below!&#10;&#10;Want more videos like this? Check these out!&#10;3D Printing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9XjbzHhqmHw&#10;Autonomous Mobility: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFxYG8_Yg-c&#10;The Future of Grocery Shopping: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BIcDLb3wbuI&#10;&#10;DO NOT FORGET TO LIKE AND SUBSCRIBE!&#10;&#10;Like and follow our Facebook Page: https://bit.ly/3d4Qnvm&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow us on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/quan...&#10;&#10;Follow our Instagram and Twitter:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/quantumvall...&#10;https://twitter.com/QuantumValleyYT&#8203;&#8203;...&#10;&#10;Check out our blog on Medium: https://quantumvalley2020.medium.com/"
