    step 0
    date "2021-06-11T07:31:03Z"
    title "Applications of Nanotechnology in Forensic Investigations"
    description "Yes! You heard it right!&#10;&#10;Nanotechnology and its allied techniques are being used to aid in our current forensic investigations. In forensic science, nanotechnology is majorly applied to develop reactive (&#8216;smart&#8217;) materials; micro-chip technology; nanomanipulators; nanoimaging tools for visualization etc. These techniques are based on the highly surface active nanomaterials that are capable of providing improved performance over the conventional techniques. Further, it enables to collect information from a crime scene that would not otherwise have been possible ever! &#10;&#10;#Nanotechnology #applicationsofnano  #nanotechnologyinforensic #forensic #nanomaterials #crimesceneanalysis #forensicscientist #investigations #crimeforensic #nanoimaging #microchip #nanotechnology #nanostructures #AmritaUniversity #AmritaNano #AmritaCenterforNanosciencesandMolecularMedicine #ACNSMM #applications #bhfyp"
