    title "Nanotechnology in Medicine | Innovation"
    description "Nanotechnology is the engineering of molecular-level functional structures. The field blends elements of physics and molecular chemistry with engineering to take advantage of the unusual properties that exist at the nanoscale. However, there are still major obstacles in terms of toxicity, environmental threats, cost of production and connectivity to remote areas that are yet to be discovered. &#10;&#10;Read More: https://www.omegaconsulting.online/post/nanotechnology-in-medicine&#10;&#10;Interested in meeting a consultant? Omega offers free synergy meetings with our consultants. &#10;&#10;To book today, please click this link: https://www.omegaconsulting.online/bookings-checkout/innovation&#10;&#10;Follow us on social media: &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/omegaconsul...&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/omegaconsult...&#10;Linkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/company/omeg...&#10;&#10;Omega partners with local small businesses for our music. Check out this wonderful growing company: &#10;&#10;Website: https://nicoleshaw.bandzoogle.com&#10;Instagram: @musicbynic_  &#10;Soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/user-363511686&#10;&#10;Omega Digital Impact! Please subscribe for more great videos!"
