    title "11th August Featured News: Nanotechnology in Agriculture | Newsletter for UPSC"
    description "Nanotechnology in Agriculture- This feature discussion is around the various ways in which nanotechnology becomes useful in the field of agriculture. The discussion also provides an insight into what nanotechnology is and what are its benefits/shortcomings.&#10;---------------------------------------------&#10;Gazette is accessible to every reader for FREE. One can also read Gazette from the Edukemy website after registering.&#10;Gazette- Newsletter for UPSC consists of 7 Segments of Carefully Curated and Balanced Articles from each segment, in accordance with UPSC CSE syllabus.  &#10;&#10;1) Feature News Article - In depth coverage of a theme &#10;2) News Snapshot- understanding of why a particular topic is in the News&#10;3) Terms and Concepts- Focused on UPSC Prelims Exam &#10;4) Editorial of the day - To build perspective around important themes requiring opinion&#10;5) Case Study- Helps you in answer writing, governance/ethics/culture, etc.&#10;6) Image of the Day&#10;7) This Day in History&#10;&#10;**************************************&#10;While Watching the video-&#10;1) First download the Gazette &#10;2) Highlight the keywords/terms- highlighting will help you build quick notes, memorize and revise&#10;&#10;************************************&#10;Gazette is released 5 days a week (Monday-Friday) on the Edukemy website in the Gazette section with complete coverage of all the relevant information of the week. &#10;&#10;Join TELEGRAM Channel for daily updates of UPSC and other important study material&#10; Main Channel- Edukemy for UPSC- https://t.me/WithEdukemy4IAS&#10;   &#10;EDUKEMY - https://www.edukemy.com/&#10;FACEBOOK- https://www.facebook.com/EdukemyforIAS/&#10;INSTAGRAM - https://www.instagram.com/edukemyforias/&#10;&#10;EMAIL - admissions@edukemy.com&#10;CONTACT US AT- +919811333782/783&#10;#upsc #upsccse #upscexam #upscaspirants #upscnews #successmeetsyou #upscpreparation #upsc2021 #upsc2022 #edukemy #edukemygazette #nanotechnology