    step 0
    date "2022-04-06T19:15:00Z"
    title "All Capabilities of Nanotechnology At This Moment"
    description "All Capabilities of Nanotechnology At This Moment&#10;&#10;&#128276; Subscribe now with all notifications on for more Nanotechnology news, Science Technology news and Future Technology news&#10;&#10;These days, you will not surprise people with the word &#8220;Nanotechnology&#8221;, yet many people do not even realize the great impact nanotechnology has on our lives. Nanotechnology is modern science, engineering, and technology, which is conducted at the nanoscale (1-100 nanometers). One nanometer is equal to a billionth of a meter. To give you a clear example, a single sheet of newspaper is 100,000 nanometers thick. You should know that atoms and molecules behave completely differently at the nanoscale.&#10;&#10;#Nanotechnology #Nanobots #Technology&#10;&#10;&#128250; Fun fact: Smart people watch the full video!&#10;_________________________________________________________________&#10;&#10;About Nano Tech News&#10;&#127909; Videos about Nanotechnology, Artificial Intelligence and Technology&#10;&#127912; Written, voiced and produced by Nano Tech News&#10;&#128276; Subscribe now for more Tech news, Future Tech and Biotechnology news videos&#10;&#10;_____________________________________________________&#10;&#128188; Contact &#38; Copyright Questions&#10;&#8226; For copyright cases, business inquiries or other inquiries please contact us at: Now.nanotech@gmail.com"
